# Keep the Braintrailz trail current

`tech-ecosystem-map/references/braintrailz.md` is the trail map for this skill — why decisions were made, not a changelog or session transcript.

When building or changing this project:

- After a durable design choice (geography-sourcing method, layout/offset conventions, verification checklist, rescan discipline), add or update a short section in `braintrailz.md`
- Capture the *why* and the failure it prevents; skip back-and-forth and housekeeping detail
- Match the existing voice: trail markers, reusable patterns, no fence
- If `tech-ecosystem-map/` source changed in a way that should ship, rebuild `tech-ecosystem-map.skill` (zip of `tech-ecosystem-map/`)

This project is held to its own standard: every fact on a map traces to a live source, and every layout change is verified structurally (counts, balanced tags, pin distance) before it ships.

Do not dump full conversations into the trail. Prefer one tight section per decision.
